 * appropriate validation error handling.
 *
 * Steps:
 *
 * 1. Register a discussion board member (who will author the post and comment).
 * 2. Register a moderator account (needed for update operation).
 * 3. Member creates a post.
 * 4. Member creates an initial comment on the post.
 * 5. Moderator attempts to update the comment with an empty body—expect a
