 * 8. The API should reject this tag removal, returning an error indicating the
 *    operation is invalid because the post is deleted.
 *
 * This ensures system integrity for soft-deleted content; the tag associations
 * cannot be altered after post removal to prevent auditing issues or
 * inconsistent navigation.
 */
