 * configuration records in the discussion_board_board_settings table. Results
 * are returned as paginated and fully formatted
 * IPageIDiscussionBoardBoardSetting objects. Filtering options include title
 * (partial/case-insensitive), enabled/disabled state, and created_at date
 * range. All output date fields are returned in ISO8601 string format. Access
 * is strictly restricted to admins (validated by presence of the `admin` param
 * contract).
 *
 * @param props - Request properties
 * @param props.admin - Authenticated admin performing the search
 * @param props.body - Search and filter criteria including pagination
 * @returns Paginated configuration records matching filter/search criteria
 * @throws {Error} If there is a database error, or admin parameter is
